 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Scan src for maximal runs of [A-Za-z0-9_]. A run is snake case when, after removing its leading underscores, it is two or more words joined by single underscores, each word lowercase letters/digits and the first word starting with a letter. Convert such runs to lower camel case (uppercase the first character of each later word, digits unchanged) keeping the leading underscores; leave every other character and run unchanged.",
